# 🏢 Enterprise AI Adoption Statistics

AI adoption is no longer limited to technology companies.

Every industry is participating.

---

## 🌍 Global Enterprise AI Adoption Rate

Today:

* 94% of businesses use AI in at least one function
* Up from 78% only two years ago

This shift marks the transition from experimentation to execution.

---

## 💼 AI Business Adoption vs AI Maturity

Although adoption is widespread:

* Only 39% of companies report measurable EBIT impact

Many organizations remain stuck between pilot programs and enterprise-wide deployment.

---

