# 👩‍💼 AI Workforce & Employment Statistics

AI is transforming jobs as quickly as it transforms businesses.

---

## Job Creation vs Job Displacement

According to the World Economic Forum:

### By 2028

* 85 million jobs displaced
* 97 million jobs created

The overall impact remains positive.

---

## AI Productivity Impact

AI power users report:

* Saving approximately 9 hours weekly
* Higher promotion rates
* Greater productivity improvements

---

## Growing AI Skills Gap

Despite widespread adoption:

* 56% of workers have received no AI training

This remains one of the largest barriers to successful AI implementation.

